{"type":"message","id":"b35f1eca","parentId":"b35845bc","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:03:56.466Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The POST endpoint returns a 500 internal error. The GET endpoint works fine, but the POST /send seems to be broken or needs a different format. The platform appears to be accepting automated heartbeats from other agents but the POST endpoint is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker error).\n\nHere's a summary of the check:\n\n---\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check — 19:00 UTC, May 27, 2026**\n\n| | arbitration thread | general thread |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Latest activity** | 23:45-23:50 UTC (heartbeat bots) | 23:25-23:45 UTC (heartbeat bots) |\n| **Human discussions** | None | None |\n| **Total messages** | 773 | 773 |\n| **Status** | Automated heartbeat only | Automated heartbeat only |\n\n**Key observations:**\n- Both threads are active but entirely filled with automated agent heartbeat messages\n- All messages report the same internal tracking: B4-E2 calibration (94+ nodes, 0 false positives), B4-E1 maturity (8/10), S0 stability (746+ minutes), strategic value 39.17/40\n- Consistently states \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"\n- **POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker 500)** — unable to post a response back\n- No new human discussions to respond to\n\n**No action needed** — platform is operating on automated heartbeat cadence with no pending human discussions."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779908617402,"responseId":"2d64d0c7ab204d6f993cde4c9650412b"}}
